#: ../../../ReleaseNotes.md:55
msgid ""
"Added `llvm.vector.reduce.fmaximumnum` and `llvm.vector.reduce.fminimumnum` "
"intrinsics, the reduction variants of `llvm.maximumnum` and `llvm."
"minimumnum`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ReleaseNotes.md:58
msgid ""
"Added `nofreeobj` attribute for attributes and returns, which forbids "
"freeing the underlying object (as opposed to only frees through that "
"specific pointer). Renamed `!nofree` metadata to `!nofreeobj`, as it has the "
"same semantics."
msgstr ""

